  {
   "path": "sections.story.10.zh",
   "before": "最后，除伦道夫、梅森、格里三人外，所有成员都签了字，会议随即无期休会。最后几人签字时，富兰克林望着议长椅背上画着的太阳，对身边几位成员说，画家很难在画里分清朝阳与落日：“会期之中，随着我对结果时而希望、时而担心，我一次又一次地望着主席身后那个太阳，却分不出它是在升起还是在落下；如今，我终于欣慰地知道，那是一轮升起的太阳，而不是落下的。”",
   "after": "最后，除伦道夫、梅森、格里三人外，所有成员都签了字，会议随即无期休会。最后几人签字时，富兰克林望着主席椅背上画着的一轮初升的太阳，对身边几位成员说，画家很难在画里分清朝阳与落日：“会期之中，随着我对结果时而希望、时而担心，我一次又一次地望着主席身后那个太阳，却分不出它是在升起还是在落下；如今，我终于欣慰地知道，那是一轮升起的太阳，而不是落下的。”",
   "issues": [
    "F2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "path": "sections.story.10.en",
   "before": "In the end every member signed except Randolph, Mason and Gerry, who declined to give the Constitution the sanction of their names; the convention then dissolved itself by an adjournment sine die, without naming a day to return. While the last members were signing, Franklin looked toward the president's chair, at the back of which a sun happened to be painted, and remarked to the few members near him that painters had found it difficult in their art to tell a rising sun from a setting one. \"I have,\" said he, \"often and often, in the course of the session, and the vicissitudes of my hopes and fears as to its issue, looked at that behind the president, without being able to tell whether it was rising or setting; but now, at length, I have the happiness to know that it is a rising, and not a setting sun.\"",
   "after": "In the end every member signed except Randolph, Mason and Gerry, who declined to give the Constitution the sanction of their names; the convention then dissolved itself by an adjournment sine die, without naming a day to return. While the last members were signing, Franklin looked toward the president's chair, at the back of which a rising sun happened to be painted, and remarked to the few members near him that painters had found it difficult in their art to tell a rising sun from a setting one. \"I have,\" said he, \"often and often, in the course of the session, and the vicissitudes of my hopes and fears as to its issue, looked at that behind the president, without being able to tell whether it was rising or setting; but now, at length, I have the happiness to know that it is a rising, and not a setting sun.\"",
   "issues": [
    "F2"
   ]
